A||N||5||MikeSchaefer||Seatback question||||4||
Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||05-03-2001||01:16 AM||||Hi, can you swap a passenger side seatback with a driver's side?  I would like to fix a grey 86 coupe's driver's side tear.  Does anyone have a PERFECT passenger side seatback (if it is possible)?  The car only has 40k on it, so it has to be almost brand new looking.<BR>Thanks a million,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||4
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||05-03-2001||01:41 AM||||I dont think you can do that.. (Dont hold me to this)..<P><BR>But I know you can pull the cover off & swap it.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">     </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><P><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 05-03-2001).]||||reg||11
Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||05-03-2001||06:28 AM||||It can be done but not as easy as a cushion.  I have one of mine apart now, the covers can be switched, just a re and re.  You can unbolt the reclining mechanism but the other side must be cut off and a new mount made. The hinge mount (console side) is part of the back plate. Then a new mount must be made and installed and the recliner (from a driver's side) remounted on the proper side.  An alternate repair is to remove the foam and replace with a better pad (or portion thereof). A PITA either way, I'm afraid.<BR>Gary||||reg||8
Z||000003||skitime||05-03-2001||08:26 AM||||Just swap the skins, not the seatback.  All you will need is a hogring pliers and some hogrings. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||05-03-2001||08:27 AM||||Easier to replace seat cover.  Find a good replacement from a passenger side and switch.<P>You cannot switch the seats themselves.||||reg||3
Z||000005||MikeSchaefer||05-03-2001||02:34 PM||||Yeah that makes more sense, thanks for the help.  Does anyone have a good skin for sale?<BR>Thanks again,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> <BR>||||reg||6
